## Risks and Correctness Notes

1) Potential change-bit acknowledge semantics issue in EHCI/xHCI service flow
- Connect Status Change bits are RW1C/RWC by spec.
- Current service code clears these bits in local value before write, which may not correctly acknowledge on all hardware.
- Needs controller-accurate RW1C handling review.

2) Header comment drift in usb.c
- Top comment still states no operational register programming.
- Current code now performs real lifecycle register programming in backends.
- Comment should be refreshed to reflect present behavior.

